  <p>Goince ekta Bangladeshi online shop. Amader lokkho — valo product, sotik dam, ar Cash on Delivery-te nischinte kenakata.</p>
  <h3>Amra ja dei</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cash on Delivery</strong> — product hate peye taka dao.</li>
    <li><strong>Fast delivery</strong> — Dhaka-r vitore 1–2 din, Dhaka-r baire 3–5 din.</li>
    <li><strong>Phone confirmation</strong> — prottek order dispatch-er age phone-e confirm kora hoy.</li>
    <li><strong>Return</strong> — defective ba vul product pele 24 ghontar vitore janale replacement / refund-er bebostha ache.</li>
  </ul>
